{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"runkin_female","model_identifier":"runkin_female","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# runkin_female\n\nRunkin female villager (A2), 1.5 m = 53 u (hair to 54).\n\nSame lean, long-limbed build as the male. Pale dappled skin, hair worn longer (to mid-back) with two beaded braids and a feather, fringed hide dress to the knee with a laced front and bead necklace, hide leggings and moccasins. Baseline skeleton and slot names.\n\n- Cubes: 30 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -8.5..8.5, y 0.0..56.0, z -5.0..4.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 54 x 12 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.6 | loop | breathing, look around |\n| `walk` | 0.85 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.52 | loop |  |\n| `fish` | 1.8 | loop | key 1.01 s (0.56 of 1.8 s): spear point strikes the water (spear-fishing jab, loops) |\n| `skin_carcass` | 2 | loop | kneeling, flint knife strokes (loop; key 0.6 s for the deep cut if needed) |\n| `sit_fire` | 4 | loop | sitting on the ground, hands to the fire, rubbing them now and then (loop) |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | hit from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on the back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 44.4 u/s (1.25 m/s), cycle 0.85 s\n- `run`: 135.1 u/s (3.80 m/s), cycle 0.52 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `fish`: key 1.01 s (0.56 of 1.8 s): spear point strikes the water (spear-fishing jab, loops)\n- `skin_carcass`: kneeling, flint knife strokes (loop; key 0.6 s for the deep cut if needed)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 53, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 37, 4.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 40, 4.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 44.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 35.5, -4.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7, 22.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10, 28.75, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 22.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (6, 29, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-6, 29, 2.5)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `flint_spear` (hidden preview, under slot_hand_r): Runkin flint fishing spear 1.8 m (64 u), grip 20 u from the butt\n- `flint_knife` (hidden preview, under slot_hand_r): leaf-shaped knapped blade for skin_carcass\n\n## Second grips (two-handed items)\n\n- fish: second grip (left hand) 14 u forward of the right-hand grip on the flint spear\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `runkin_female_moss.png`: moss-green dress\n- `runkin_female_ochre.png`: ochre dress, browner hair\n\n## Notes\n\n- The dress skirt is a short fixed piece on the hips plus two fringed hem halves on the thighs, so legs never poke through.\n- Lean, long-limbed: 1.5 m tall with legs 23 u and arms reaching mid-thigh.\n"},"description":"# runkin_female\n\nRunkin female villager (A2), 1.5 m = 53 u (hair to 54).\n\nSame lean, long-limbed build as the male. Pale dappled skin, hair worn longer (to mid-back) with two beaded braids and a feather, fringed hide dress to the knee with a laced front and bead necklace, hide leggings and moccasins. Baseline skeleton and slot names.\n\n- Cubes: 30 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -8.5..8.5, y 0.0..56.0, z -5.0..4.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 54 x 12 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.6 | loop | breathing, look around |\n| `walk` | 0.85 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.52 | loop |  |\n| `fish` | 1.8 | loop | key 1.01 s (0.56 of 1.8 s): spear point strikes the water (spear-fishing jab, loops) |\n| `skin_carcass` | 2 | loop | kneeling, flint knife strokes (loop; key 0.6 s for the deep cut if needed) |\n| `sit_fire` | 4 | loop | sitting on the ground, hands to the fire, rubbing them now and then (loop) |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | hit from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on the back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 44.4 u/s (1.25 m/s), cycle 0.85 s\n- `run`: 135.1 u/s (3.80 m/s), cycle 0.52 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `fish`: key 1.01 s (0.56 of 1.8 s): spear point strikes the water (spear-fishing jab, loops)\n- `skin_carcass`: kneeling, flint knife strokes (loop; key 0.6 s for the deep cut if needed)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 53, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 37, 4.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 40, 4.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 44.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 35.5, -4.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7, 22.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10, 28.75, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 22.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (6, 29, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-6, 29, 2.5)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `flint_spear` (hidden preview, under slot_hand_r): Runkin flint fishing spear 1.8 m (64 u), grip 20 u from the butt\n- `flint_knife` (hidden preview, under slot_hand_r): leaf-shaped knapped blade for skin_carcass\n\n## Second grips (two-handed items)\n\n- fish: second grip (left hand) 14 u forward of the right-hand grip on the flint spear\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `runkin_female_moss.png`: moss-green dress\n- `runkin_female_ochre.png`: ochre dress, browner hair\n\n## Notes\n\n- The dress skirt is a short fixed piece on the hips plus two fringed hem halves on the thighs, so legs never poke through.\n- Lean, long-limbed: 1.5 m tall with legs 23 u and arms reaching mid-thigh.\n","resolution":{"wi